709/semantic-kg-rag-handoff-validator.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Represented rows: 3530\n- Source layer entries: 3530\n- Source semantic assertions: 3\n- Source blocked_quarantined entries: 3527\n- Query surfaces: 7\n- Prerequisite candidates: 0\n- Misconception candidates: 0\n- Mastery signal candidates: 0\n- RAG consumption fixtures: 5\n- RAG fixture pass/fail: 5/0\n- Validator checks: 12 pass / 0 fail\n- Production RAG reindex: 0\n- Vector store mutations: 0\n- Runtime API integrations: 0\n- Frontend integrations: 0\n- External model/API calls: 0\n\n## Query Surfaces\n\n- `question_concepts`\n- `required_skills`\n- `procedures`\n- `prerequisite_context`\n- `misconception_candidates`\n- `syllabus_alignment`\n- `evidence_posture`\n\n## RAG Consumption Boundary\n\n- Accepted semantic edges may enter answer context with provenance.\n- Provisional edges require visible posture downgrade.\n- Candidate-only edges are downgraded and cannot be presented as accepted facts.\n- Review-required edges are review-only excluded from answer context.\n- Rejected and blocked_quarantined edges are excluded; blocked_quarantined remains terminal regardless of confidence.\n- No production RAG reindex, vector store mutation, runtime API/frontend integration, Supabase mutation, or external model call.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.mjs --write` -> pass, validation_status `pass`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.test.js` -> pass, 6/6 tests\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.mjs` -> pass\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.test.js` -> pass\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-rag-handoff-contract.test.js` -> pass\n- `git diff --check` -> pass\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> warning only: branch naming and expected worktree changes before commit; workflow guards healthy\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T04:52:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T04:54:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T04:54:14Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T04:54:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"9d331e19e69b775ad62595a26e8a5491efe678b5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1357/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1357/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1357/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/bf987adbb76626149ae059d8807d94ab40ca89fa","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1330","ref":"feat/issue-1330","sha":"bf987adbb76626149ae059d8807d94ab40ca89fa","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/rece